    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n8 Mill Street is a three-bedroom mid-terrace residence, located in the heart of Westport Town, that has been completely refurbished and modernised to an exceptionally high standard throughout. \n\nWith a floor area of approximately 73.4sqm/790sqft, ground floor accommodation comprises of an entrance porch with patterned ceramic tiling and wall panelling, entrance hallway with understair storage, a cosy living room with feature cast iron original fireplace, hi-gloss kitchen with a granite worktop and garden/patio access, and a double bedroom. The first floor offers two double bedrooms, a shower room with dramatic marble effect porcelain tiles and a storage press. \n\nThe property is presented in turn-key condition with upgrades including sash windows to the front, wood and carpeted flooring, tiling, appliances, panelling, censored lighting and bathroom suites.\n\nExternally, there is a raised garden to the rear accessed via stairs off the enclosed courtyard area which benefits from feature exposed stone walls. \n\nThere is also a modernised 'Outhouse' (6'11\" x 5'3\"), which is utilised as a utility room and WC.\n\nRarely does a home of this quality and central location come to the market that has been finished to such a high standard. It would ideally suit a first-time buyer, someone wishing to downsize into town for convenience or alternately as a holiday home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.74m x 1.1m\nTiled floor, feature wood panel wall\n\nEntrance Hall - 5.0m x 1.2m\n\n\n& - 1.1m x 0.9m\nSolid Asian oak floor, painted staircase with carpeted runner, understair storage\n\nBedroom One - 3.2m x 2.8m\nSolid Asian oak floor, feature crittall door, picture frame wall panelling, mounted bedside lamps, blinds\n\nLiving Room - 3.2m x 2.5m\nCarpeted floor, wallpapered wall, feature cast-iron fireplace, electric Roman blinds\n\nKitchen/Diner - 3.1m x 2.3m\nSolid Asian oak floor, hi-gloss kitchen with soft close doors, granite worktop, integrated oven/hob, integrated dishwasher, integrated fridge, door to back patio and garden\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 3.3m x 0.9m\nSolid Asian oak floor, censored lighting\n\nBedroom Two - 3.1m x 2.3m\nCarpeted, blinds\n\nBedrooom Three - 4.5m x 2.9m\nSolid Asian oak floor, feature cast iron fireplace, blinds\n\nBathroom - 2.4m x 1.9m\nFully tiled, feature light mirror, shower, wc, whb vanity unit\n\nHotpress - 1.0m x 0.9m\nShelved\n\nOut House - 2.1m x 1.6m\nwc, whb, washing machine ,storage unit\n\n"
      },
